{"page":100,"width":1758,"height":2337,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"평을 늘어놓는다. 그리고 이러한 경고가 나쁜 에러로부터 프로그래머를 지켜주기도","words":[{"text":"평을","x":251,"y":186,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"늘어놓는다.","x":333,"y":184,"width":176,"height":36},{"text":"그리고","x":528,"y":185,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"이러한","x":642,"y":185,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"경고가","x":754,"y":185,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"나쁜","x":863,"y":184,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"에러로부터","x":943,"y":184,"width":165,"height":34},{"text":"프로그래머를","x":1128,"y":182,"width":219,"height":35},{"text":"지켜주기도","x":1365,"y":181,"width":201,"height":36}]},{"text":"한다.","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":249,"y":254,"width":77,"height":34}]},{"text":"static-cast는 변환되는 값을 확인하지 않는다. 이를 올바로 사용하는 것은 끄그","words":[{"text":"static-cast는","x":251,"y":344,"width":229,"height":31},{"text":"변환되는","x":496,"y":342,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"값을","x":640,"y":342,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"확인하지","x":716,"y":341,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"않는다.","x":859,"y":340,"width":104,"height":35},{"text":"이를","x":985,"y":341,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"올바로","x":1064,"y":340,"width":105,"height":34},{"text":"사용하는","x":1184,"y":340,"width":147,"height":35},{"text":"것은","x":1349,"y":340,"width":78,"height":34},{"text":"끄그","x":1444,"y":339,"width":123,"height":28}]},{"text":"래머의 몫이다. 물론 이러한 가정이 항상 옳지는 않다. 의심스러운 경우에는 값을","words":[{"text":"래머의","x":251,"y":411,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"몫이다.","x":368,"y":410,"width":107,"height":34},{"text":"물론","x":497,"y":411,"width":67,"height":32},{"text":"이러한","x":582,"y":409,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"가정이","x":696,"y":409,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"항상","x":808,"y":408,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"옳지는","x":889,"y":408,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"않다.","x":1007,"y":408,"width":74,"height":34},{"text":"의심스러운","x":1106,"y":408,"width":178,"height":34},{"text":"경우에는","x":1305,"y":408,"width":156,"height":34},{"text":"값을","x":1483,"y":403,"width":83,"height":3